# What `docker build` may NOT see (the build context is the repo root). Keeps images small,
# builds cache-friendly, and secrets out: images are public on GHCR.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.github
.claude
**/.claude
.env
.env.*
coverage
docs
*.md
# Generated in the image by `prisma generate`, never copied from the host (it may be stale).
packages/db/src/generated
# Tests and their helpers don't ship (test-database.ts needs Testcontainers, a dev dependency).
**/*.test.ts
packages/db/src/test-database.ts
